# karatep: turn on Fluence dual-mic noise suppression for capture. The hardware
# has two analog mics and advertises FLUENCE_DUAL_MIC, but the vendor shipped
# every persist switch off, so capture used the single-mic snd_device. Measured
# on hardware: noise floor 19 dB lower, speech 2 dB louder (73: dmic-endfire).
#
# post-fs-data, because persist.* properties are loaded from /data during it.
# The voicecall and speaker switches are left alone until a call can be tested.
on post-fs-data
    setprop persist.vendor.audio.fluence.audiorec true
    setprop persist.vendor.audio.fluence.voicerec true
